menu "espOS-8relay debug console"

    config APP_DEBUG_CONSOLE
        bool "Enable interactive debug console (esp_console REPL over USB serial/JTAG)"
        default y
        help
            Runs an esp_console REPL over the native USB serial/JTAG port
            alongside normal logging, with commands to inspect and toggle
            device state without needing network reachability. See issue #16.

endmenu
